    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68186ea038d595a37035ba6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──福岛远征。原本体重略微减轻的双涡轮，\n在这场远征中大幅恢复！\n看来连吃的东西都很合她的胃口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b87e0d7bf00d28c6887e9a50e044ea9267c0d11fa49e3e650769574ccfbfc94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066411.json",
