    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a87c5c15bc86872853358a74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "福岛赛场有急弯，\n而且是没有坡道的独特赛道。\n能否好好运用这特殊条件将决定胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4293fa299b142c20b725d881f6c28f655dde26b81bd892f60e3f1bb0d0702ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
