      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”当天。\n东海帝王达成奇迹般的复出，\n并对双涡轮说道──",
      "source_fingerprint": "efca5698b140396897a99d836323d4c25bb6665e1a3b58c6e1bca0d353b55435",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
