      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我比任何人都想赢过你！”\n因为被东海帝王认可为劲敌，\n让双涡轮充满斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af878addf23f901d0b0b212c75b907221370235315dfbcbf1170af1576950d37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
