      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然跑完了出道战，\n但在重赏比赛观众会更多。\n必须想办法解决她的过度“胆小”才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11c49ba5cf8bbecc10419bb3bbfb802182b1b57c5c5f962a76e3b71deb0c8c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
