      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胆小是不安的表现，\n只要跟大拓太阳神与目白善信交流，\n应该就能靠快乐消除不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05e5ef82c352cff54fb2b2136fa09e11a5e552cd9ee6955b0b84f6ba3d44615",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
