      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后还要跑更多比赛，\n好好习惯各种竞赛与赛马娘吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51897f99592edb5ea1d79a014045b61a605184b5cd897bee3a51debd54fc8ca6",
