      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，她还有弱点。\n比赛中，她会喘不过气而筋疲力尽。\n想赢经典三冠恐怕很难吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a13123fcbd44bb6aea842f6ef962d263c9bda1eb5576222a0d7693221593ea5",
